    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): run the checks side by side and the suite in shards\n\nSim checks builds the Rust core once, then runs the suite (in four\nshards), the digests, the trials and the scaling check as parallel jobs;\nthe sim-checks job prints the same SUMMARY block once all are done. CI\nruns lint and the static checks, the GDScript suite (in four shards) and\nthe scaling check as separate jobs. shard_tests.py balances the test\nfiles across shards by their recorded times (test_times.json); each file\nruns whole in one shard. Godot setup is one composite action.\n\nRecords Q22 (retiring a GDScript reference and its parity checks) for a\ndesign session.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D25MB57Z7nmE6u7pDpd3yj",
